---------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY WORK IMPLEMENTED HERE
---------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers the code in this repository. It does not, and
cannot, claim the published algorithms that code implements. The
following are reimplementations of work by others, attributed in the
source files that implement them:

  - Gated DeltaNet — the recurrent update rule in hvn/core/deltanet.py
  - GLA / Mamba-2 — the per-channel data-dependent decay gate
  - Mamba / RWKV-7 — the output gate and short causal depthwise conv
  - BitNet b1.58 — ternary weight quantisation, hvn/edge/ternary.py
  - BAdam — block-coordinate descent, hvn/core/block_coordinate.py
  - ALBERT — cross-layer weight sharing, hvn/edge/shared.py
  - Chinchilla (Hoffmann et al.) — the tokens-per-parameter framing
  - Fill-in-the-Middle (Bavarian et al.) — hvn/fim.py

Anyone is free to implement those papers themselves; this license
restricts only this particular implementation of them.


---------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON WHAT THIS LICENSE CAN AND CANNOT DO
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Stated plainly rather than left to be discovered:

  - This is not an OSI-approved "open source" license. Repository hosts
    will label it as non-standard, and some users and package indexes
    avoid non-standard licenses on principle.

  - Restrictions of this kind are difficult to enforce in practice
    against a large organisation, and enforcement would require the
    author's own time and money. The main practical effect is to make
    unauthorised use visible and indefensible rather than to prevent it.

  - The thresholds are deliberately generous to small users. If you are
    a person with a gaming GPU, a student, a freelancer, or a small
    company, this license is written to let you use this freely,
    including to earn a living.
